\f1\b \cf0 THE MUSIC APP
\f0\b0 \
We are starting to develop a web-based program or app that would act as an organizing interface, and searchable database for all of our music, allowing any branch member to look up all the music we use, and to access sheet music and audio examples.\
Someone could use it to find songs for a Lord\'92s Day, a family prayer time, or make a playlist to listen to.\
A music leader could create setlists and share them with ministry members, or check what other branches are using or have added lately.\
A meeting leader, inspired by a prophetic word just given, could type in that particular theme: a list of a dozen songs pops up, he shows it to the music leader, and asks \'93these weren\'92t on the list but could you possible do one of them?\'94\
This sheet illustrates the current plan of functional structure: I: How the database gets populated; II: What the user interface flow would be like; III: How the user interface might behave.}